---
description: This rule limits the scope of changes made during coding tasks to avoid unintended modifications across files. It is helpful for maintaining control over large projects.
globs: **/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx}
alwaysApply: false
---
Avoid making sweeping changes across files unless explicitly requested.

Confirm with the user before proceeding with large edits or refactoring tasks.

Focus on solving one issue or implementing one feature at a time to maintain clarity and control.